            <div xml:id="d213">

                <pb facs="0384" n="296" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg296"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72/12285: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-18T20:00:00+01:00"
                            >November 18, 1918—8 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 19—3:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2378. I hear that the French have taken over bay near Fiume. They say as naval
                    base for their troops in the country, reason which Italians seem to
                    question.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
